msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Quick Start Guide\n"
"\n"
"This guide will help you quickly get started with the project. Please follow the steps below to install, configure, and run the project.\n"
"\n"
"## Installation\n"
"\n"
"First, ensure that your system meets the following requirements:\n"
"\n"
"- Python 3.8 or higher\n"
"- pip (Python package manager)\n"
"\n"
"Then, use the following command to install the project dependencies:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Configuration\n"
"\n"
"Before running the project, you need to configure some environment variables. Create a `.env` file in the project root directory and add the following content:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"DATABASE_URL=your_database_connection_string\n"
"SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Running\n"
"\n"
"Once the installation and configuration are complete, you can start the project with the following command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"python manage.py runserver\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After starting, open your browser and visit `http://127.0.0.1:8000` to view the application.\n"
"\n"
"## Testing\n"
"\n"
"To run the tests, use the following command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pytest\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Common Issues\n"
"\n"
"- **Database connection failure**: Check whether the `DATABASE_URL` is correctly configured.\n"
"- **Port conflict**: If port 8000 is already in use, you can specify another port with `python manage.py runserver 8080`.\n"
"\n"
"If you encounter other issues, please refer to the project documentation or submit an issue.\n"

msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, used for efficient kernel auto-tuning, operator compilation, and deployment. By being compatible with Triton's core syntax and performing deep optimization for Ascend NPU features, it helps users quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

msgid "本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法实例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr "This document uses the example of online installation and running a vector addition instance through software package deployment in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment to guide users in quickly getting started with **Triton-Ascend**. For more installation methods, please refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) document."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

msgid "支持的操作系统：linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2/A3/950系列"
msgstr "Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2/A3/950 series"

msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr "Minimum hardware configuration: single card with 32GB memory (recommended)"

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》 完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine the CANN, Python, and TorchNPU software versions and install them. For reference, you can follow the \"[CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\" guide on the Ascend community official website to complete the driver and firmware installation."

msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

msgid "Python版本：python3.11"
msgstr "Python version: python3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more information on compatible versions, please refer to the [Version Release Notes](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\\n"
msgstr "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "**运行tutorials中向量加法实例验证结果**"
msgstr "**Run the vector addition example in tutorials to verify the results**"

msgid "向量加法实例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr "Vector addition example: [01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) demonstrates that the Ascend NPU device can correctly invoke Triton operators and ensure computational accuracy by comparing the output results of Triton operators with those of PyTorch native computation."

msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在 bash 环境下执行。若使用 POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr "⚠️ The following commands need to be executed in a bash environment. If using POSIX sh, replace `source` with `.`."

msgid "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)\\n"
msgstr "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)"

msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr "Observing similar output indicates that the environment is configured correctly."

msgid "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\\n"
msgstr "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')"
